ons and delivers deals to legions of fellow coupon clippers. On the trail to total coupon dominance, a hapless Loss Prevention Officer from the local supermarket chain joins forces with a determined U.S. Postal Inspector in hot pursuit of these newly minted “Queenpins” of pink collar crime.","tagline":"Couponing goes criminal."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/haKKKWrHV1EIS3MOsV3hUICL6O2.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4t8T9NCte10R5CAXVhHDnmkPd3X.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":628914,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/haKKKWrHV1EIS3MOsV3hUICL6O2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/haKKKWrHV1EIS3MOsV3hUICL6O2.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1501},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/haKKKWrHV1EIS3MOsV3hUICL6O2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/haKKKWrHV1EIS3MOsV3hUICL6O2.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1501}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p5Uz76EOwj9rAsdGxYL8IZGPV2B.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p5Uz76EOwj9rAsdGxYL8IZGPV2B.jpg","language":"en","width":1400,"height":2100},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p5Uz76EOwj9rAsdGxYL8IZGPV2B.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p5Uz76EOwj9rAsdGxYL8IZGPV2B.jpg","language":"en","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/55uYpBNnlsUE9fCb3Eibx7F4zps.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/55uYpBNnlsUE9fCb3Eibx7F4zps.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9Uiztz5bT9ooxLeDg77RFW6GWiR.jpg","previewUrl":"ht